{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">大圍沙田頭路新田圍社區會堂對開，有巴士與私家車相撞，四人送院。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">涉事黑色私家車一度起火，嚴重損毀，座椅也燒到變形，由消防到場救熄。巴士擋風玻璃碎裂，掉到地上。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.TA.ST-0300_003.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026vHL1a0ui7Q1790195719.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.TA.ST-0300_003.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">警方在凌晨近1時接獲巴士司機報案。事件中，私家車司機及兩名乘客受傷。巴士司機亦報稱不適，共四人送威爾斯醫院治理。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-23T20:58:34.683356+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}